#: f32155e68a474b269d26f3a69c1600bd feadfa40679341618424e5d9074f5535
msgid ""
"The R3 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all"
" ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which "
"require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this "
"manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"R3 引脚默认映射为定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的接收机协议，但 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 除外（它们需要真正的 UART"
" 连接）。但以此方式连接的 FPort 只能提供 RC 信号而无数传。"

